\f1\fs22 By seven o\'92clock, Major Midler had watched the end of 
\f2\i Candid Criminal
\f1\i0  four times. He recognised Shakti security insignias on the sleeves of its loudest members, and on many more sleeves besides, only hands away from some of the best automatic rifles a private militia could buy, which in Shakti\'92s case was probably much better funded soldier-for-soldier than the UDF itself.\
